msgid "ArduPilot Libraries"
msgstr "ArduPilot 库"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:7
#: 3192931d3b9e45739a33e511861f2cdd
msgid ""
"The \\ `libraries "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries>`__ are shared"
" with Copter, Plane and Rover. Below is a high level list of libraries and "
"their function."
msgstr ""
"`库 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries>`__ 由 "
"Copter、Plane 和 Rover 共享。以下是库及其功能的高层列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:11
#: 93008ffbd5494e62bd4a09b57fe59a10
msgid "**Core libraries:**"
msgstr "**核心库：**"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:13
#: 9e8feaa573a848f1bffe9be73eec849d
msgid ""
"`AP_AHRS "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_AHRS>`__ - "
"attitude estimation using DCM or EKF"
msgstr ""
"`AP_AHRS "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_AHRS>`__ - "
"使用 DCM 或 EKF 进行姿态估计"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:15
#: 1b91bc5c362c4bffa5e37175bf667572
msgid ""
"`AP_Common "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Common>`__ "
"- core includes required by all sketches and libraries"
msgstr ""
"`AP_Common "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Common>`__ "
"- 所有 sketch 和库所需的核心头文件"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:17
#: 0b4e882fce3240ffa3bda63d61c20918
msgid ""
"`AP_Math "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Math>`__ - "
"various math functions especially useful for vector manipulation"
msgstr ""
"`AP_Math "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Math>`__ - "
"各种数学函数，尤其适用于向量运算"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:19
#: 003cafd0537a475aafd0067fc74df0f0
msgid ""
"`AC_PID "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AC_PID>`__ - "
"PID(Proportional-Integral-Derivative) controller library"
msgstr ""
"`AC_PID "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AC_PID>`__ - "
"PID（比例-积分-微分）控制器库"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:21
#: bda984040dec4c379e97ef6aa482e521
msgid ""
"`AP_InertialNav "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_InertialNav>`__"
" - inertial navigation library for blending accelerometer inputs with gps "
"and baro data"
msgstr ""
"`AP_InertialNav "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_InertialNav>`__"
" - 惯性导航库，用于融合加速度计输入与 GPS 和气压计数据"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:24
#: 6e095645724b4976ad1cc9cd0a9088d0
msgid ""
"`AC_AttitudeControl "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AC_AttitudeControl>`__"
" - ArduCopter's control library includes various functions of attitude, "
"position control based on PID control."
msgstr ""
"`AC_AttitudeControl "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AC_AttitudeControl>`__"
" - ArduCopter 控制库，包含基于 PID 控制的姿态和位置控制各种函数。"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:27
#: bd94941aef3945cabddd39c0c4e89a82
msgid ""
"`AC_WPNav "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AC_WPNav>`__ -"
" waypoint navigation library"
msgstr ""
"`AC_WPNav "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AC_WPNav>`__ -"
" 航点导航库"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:29
#: 851eb84775a54f33a413c2b40b14e5c8
msgid ""
"`AP_Motors "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Motors>`__ "
"- multicopter and traditional helicopter motor mixing"
msgstr ""
"`AP_Motors "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Motors>`__ "
"- 多旋翼和传统直升机电机混控"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:31
#: 35eb4552b69e4fe78240e64bc1ec5e35
msgid ""
"`RC_Channel "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/RC_Channel>`__"
" - a library to more convert pwm input/output from APM_RC into internal "
"units such as angles"
msgstr ""
"`RC_Channel "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/RC_Channel>`__"
" - 将 APM_RC 的 PWM 输入/输出转换为角度等内部单位的库"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:34
#: 28bd213c878a49f5a0227377effa110a
msgid ""
"`AP_HAL "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL>`__, "
"`AP_HAL_ChibiOS "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS>`__,"
" `AP_HAL_Linux "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_Linux>`__"
" - libraries to implement the \"Hardware abstraction layer\" which presents "
"an identical interface to the high level code so that it can more easily be "
"ported to different boards."
msgstr ""
"`AP_HAL "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL>`__、`AP_HAL_ChibiOS"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS>`__、`AP_HAL_Linux"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_Linux>`__"
" - 实现 「硬件抽象层」 的库，为高层代码提供统一接口，使其更容易移植到不同飞控板。"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:41
#: 9dbb8c915227414890fdb0744c805c08
msgid "**Sensor libraries:**"
msgstr "**传感器库：**"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:43
#: 13b9f175aad047209d3c42aa11668786
msgid ""
"`AP_InertialSensor "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_InertialSensor>`__"
" - reads gyro and accelerometer data, perform calibration and provides data "
"in standard units (deg/s, m/s) to main code and other libraries"
msgstr ""
"`AP_InertialSensor "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_InertialSensor>`__"
" - 读取陀螺仪和加速度计数据，执行校准，并以标准单位（deg/s、m/s）向主代码和其他库提供数据"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:46
#: f2a9c3726a75401f8c84610687512025
msgid ""
"`AP_RangeFinder "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_RangeFinder>`__"
" - sonar and ir distance sensor interfaced library"
msgstr ""
"`AP_RangeFinder "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_RangeFinder>`__"
" - 声纳和红外距离传感器驱动接口库"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:48
#: 69c73dbaebbe4c9e8a441b527fda98ab
msgid ""
"`AP_Baro "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Baro>`__ - "
"barometer interface library"
msgstr ""
"`AP_Baro "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Baro>`__ - "
"气压计接口库"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:50
#: 74b6aa41c71b48aa9233029ca91d73da
msgid ""
"`AP_GPS "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_GPS>`__ - "
"gps interface library"
msgstr ""
"`AP_GPS "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_GPS>`__ - "
"GPS 接口库"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:52
#: ef93b19d3bb5462bb28a07f0eb79e248
msgid ""
"`AP_Compass "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Compass>`__"
" - 3-axis compass interface library"
msgstr ""
"`AP_Compass "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Compass>`__"
" - 三轴罗盘接口库"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:54
#: dfc18c020a694c0a86113c5d56d3b8a0
msgid ""
"`AP_OpticalFlow "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_OpticalFlow>`__"
" - optical flow sensor interface library"
msgstr ""
"`AP_OpticalFlow "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_OpticalFlow>`__"
" - 光流传感器接口库"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:57
#: 57611d88355c4808af1c3a219987be7c
msgid "**Other libraries:**"
msgstr "**其他库：**"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:59
#: 65c5ccb89e5c417db8dbb8a828025c49
msgid ""
"`AP_Mount "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Mount>`__, "
"\\ `AP_Camera "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Camera>`__,"
" \\ `AP_Relay "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Relay>`__ -"
