msgstr ""
"`AP_Mount "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Mount>`__、`AP_Camera"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Camera>`__、`AP_Relay"
" <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Relay>`__ "
"- 云台控制库、相机快门控制库"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-programming-libraries.rst:61
#: 3939755b11ed4897a0e60a4141c8b527
msgid ""
"`AP_Mission "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Mission>`__"
" - stores/retrieves mission commands from eeprom"
msgstr ""
"`AP_Mission "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Mission>`__"
" - 从 EEPROM 存取任务命令"
